Red step (tests.test_downloads.MarkdownAndWord, against the T1+F1+F2
build): FAILED (failures=131), as the plan expects:
test_word_questions_are_one_cell_tables, 18 labs, e.g. "Lists differ:
[] != [4, 5, 5, 5, 4, 4, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4]" (is_label finds no label);
test_word_label_styles_add_only_an_outline_level, 19 docs x 5 levels,
"no style QuestionLabel2"...; test_word_label_levels_match_the_page,
18 labs. Green: make_reference_docx regenerates only word/styles.xml;
after a build MarkdownAndWord OK (16 tests). Full unittest: 2 errors,
both test_download_all FileNotFoundError on a media path of 270
characters (the scratch tree's location, Windows MAX_PATH), not T2.
